ieran como en la franja inmediatamente inferior, lo esperable serían 14,8 contratos. La razón entre observados y esperados es 3,2, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 2,2 a 4,7. En diciembre se adjudicó el 6 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 13 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 47 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.430 euros, se adjudicó en noviembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: El hecho de que muchos contratos estén cerca del límite no indica que haya sido un error. Puede deberse a razones legítimas, como necesidades específicas o precios del mercado.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos [1], [2] y [3] atienden la misma necesidad. Verificar si en diciembre se contrataron otros contratos cerca del límite y si hubo repeticiones de adjudicatarios.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 48 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 14.8 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 3.2, with a 95% confidence interval of 2.2 to 4.7. December accounts for 6% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 13% of all its services and supplies contracts. The contracts just under the limit are spread across 47 different awardees. Contract [1], for 14,430 euros, was awarded in November 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The data shows that some contracts are just under the limit, but it doesn't prove any wrongdoing. Prices might be lower than expected, or budgets might be fixed. The numbers alone don't show improper actions.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and amounts of the contracts to see if they align with the body's needs. Review the awardees to ensure no single provider is favored. Look at contract [1] to see what was purchased and how it fits into the overall spending pattern.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["eLas2sGAgIEaF6cS8TCh%2FA%3D%3D","Y1gIp7LDeUc2wEhQbcAqug%3D%3D","RlfVMbIPLNJrhBlEHQFSKA%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-16"}}